{"Hello! I am Bobo. Let's read a story together!":"3eb87517f885bc94.mp3","Hello! I am Nibbles. Let's read a story together!":"8d9288ed355d5065.mp3","Hello! I am Pip. Let's read a story together!":"436f1e8f22b0a965.mp3","Hello! I am Bruno. Let's read a story together!":"aa2bd6c2a5e3fb4c.mp3","Hello! I am Honey. Let's read a story together!":"ff681d9aa8bb8a6e.mp3","Hello! I am Tumble. Let's read a story together!":"c82ef0cbbcd2369a.mp3","Hello! I am Ducky. Let's read a story together!":"c8479897cdd9dcaa.mp3","Hello! I am Splash. Let's read a story together!":"0bc0353af9b86c91.mp3","Hello! I am Momo. Let's read a story together!":"26beb5505184b4ce.mp3","Hello! I am Mimi. Let's read a story together!":"bdc966958d6c0a0f.mp3","Hello! I am Pounce. Let's read a story together!":"efb98c05b3e1c755.mp3","Hello! I am Whiskers. Let's read a story together!":"a3d1c8aa23a99ae5.mp3","I don't know many words yet. Will you help me learn them?":"73774363c0e57061.mp3","Once upon a time, there were three little pigs.":"9a1f1aa4c1cf837f.mp3","The first little pig built his house out of straw.":"b358ec0d3572c300.mp3","The second little pig built his house out of sticks.":"c37cd5365874ea82.mp3","And the third little pig built his house out of strong red bricks.":"f96786a83e5b4467.mp3","But then, along came a big bad wolf!":"25b92ea16e78b99f.mp3","The wolf knocked on the door. Little pig, little pig, let me come in!":"c4d7e6c0c603c030.mp3","Not by the hair of my chinny chin chin!":"b1105ff675d7bbb6.mp3","Then I'll huff, and I'll puff, and I'll blow your house down! Blow with me! Blow into the phone!":"57619c960a78005c.mp3","Whooosh! You did it! The straw house blew away!":"509ec24a27388124.mp3","Whooosh! And the straw house blew away!":"caeb47a9b6d6f8e8.mp3","The first little pig ran to the house made of sticks!":"1d01fea033a8adda.mp3","But the wolf huffed, and he puffed, and he blew that house down too!":"2be9677379b236a4.mp3","So both little pigs ran to the house made of bricks.":"6be63261a06daf8e.mp3","The wolf huffed. And he puffed. And he huffed and he puffed.":"c14821d197d16309.mp3","But the brick house did not fall down. Bricks are too strong!":"c3021fb906542c4a.mp3","So the sneaky wolf climbed up onto the roof, and down the chimney!":"46a0b4471c866a70.mp3","But the clever little pigs had something waiting for him.":"980dc1be8341c3d2.mp3","Splash! Right into the big hot pot!":"4deee7bab09b8039.mp3","The wolf jumped up, ran out of the door, and never ever came back!":"e9828c7cc3f33cf6.mp3","And the three little pigs lived happily ever after. The end!":"443fc29d47cbb51c.mp3","Look how many words you taught me! Thank you!":"8e6e4e267f9c3b06.mp3","Ooh! What is that?":"9269efa883d4ae14.mp3","You said it! Thank you for teaching me!":"26dc2de27a35a2c7.mp3","It's a little pig!":"442b025c583d60f2.mp3","That was a pig. I will remember!":"d2cac294568482a9.mp3","Your turn! Can you say pig?":"1c27b196a8b7be40.mp3","In Spanish, we say el cerdito.":"1b22b433622e1937.mp3","pig":"ecd23d3fad020192.mp3","In Spanish, el cerdito":"04f1f73ad8524c0d.mp3","That house is made of straw.":"187a52f5847ea7cd.mp3","Straw. I will remember that!":"6244fdf0ea38e37e.mp3","Your turn! Can you say straw?":"3cc330c3ef68433b.mp3","In Spanish, we say la paja.":"527b69f7356c653a.mp3","straw":"ba06d2c0f1f5c537.mp3","In Spanish, la paja":"273bde64cf60c379.mp3","That house is made of sticks.":"6e5c6c59dc249d6a.mp3","Sticks. I will remember that!":"72479324e4684c00.mp3","Your turn! Can you say sticks?":"9c53ca175e79b6c3.mp3","In Spanish, we say los palos.":"6c93fe37222e1aa9.mp3","sticks":"60b8be8abdf98330.mp3","In Spanish, los palos":"4bf3eeacce63feaf.mp3","That house is made of strong bricks.":"263dfed1a19ce816.mp3","Bricks. I will remember that!":"c96ca64acb1bed3d.mp3","Your turn! Can you say bricks?":"ff28a9348b48d29c.mp3","In Spanish, we say los ladrillos.":"c646f56d464ca311.mp3","bricks":"034c42a9bc851839.mp3","In Spanish, los ladrillos":"10a3bdf230b716ca.mp3","It's a big bad wolf!":"24c2ac9c220fac62.mp3","That was a wolf. I will remember!":"deb85704d2dab86c.mp3","Your turn! Can you say wolf?":"033900dd2d64c5e6.mp3","In Spanish, we say el lobo.":"3b8e61d517a54756.mp3","wolf":"82c9eb80a2049fa7.mp3","In Spanish, el lobo":"0ff50748ecf17bd7.mp3","That is the chimney, on top of the roof.":"51f4d9f269226ef9.mp3","A chimney. I will remember that!":"b57e47aa07875c5b.mp3","Your turn! Can you say chimney?":"f3bcf746d32703bc.mp3","In Spanish, we say la chimenea.":"121372cc574d9de6.mp3","chimney":"f463ec81e660131a.mp3","In Spanish, la chimenea":"9758ad28f7e723b3.mp3","It's a big hot pot!":"c121dbea4a22e782.mp3","A pot. I will remember that!":"dd8857b98b57fc58.mp3","Your turn! Can you say pot?":"ce204fe9dedbaa98.mp3","In Spanish, we say la olla.":"391a232c97d2d262.mp3","pot":"2860488bc592a40c.mp3","In Spanish, la olla":"a5781d668ad2311b.mp3","Who wants to come with you today?":"e5c943cf414d9d49.mp3","Hooray! My name is Bobo!":"3bb60f5574c2fb34.mp3","Hooray! My name is Nibbles!":"4b2cdcd314c96bd4.mp3","Hooray! My name is Pip!":"3edcab4f98994e72.mp3","Hooray! My name is Bruno!":"8d9cec03d006af41.mp3","Hooray! My name is Honey!":"bee52667dda13ed6.mp3","Hooray! My name is Tumble!":"8d753941d25edd8c.mp3","Hooray! My name is Ducky!":"5753364313a7e58e.mp3","Hooray! My name is Splash!":"bd3fd0652c23c334.mp3","Hooray! My name is Momo!":"e7a30d885c46a83e.mp3","Hooray! My name is Mimi!":"482f99f9b515b0cb.mp3","Hooray! My name is Pounce!":"9cdf898fc41239ff.mp3","Hooray! My name is Whiskers!":"7f533191247cd459.mp3","What shall we call your bunny?":"fdf4cac73f10a4d4.mp3","What shall we call your bear?":"705d032f5fc00c5a.mp3","What shall we call your duck?":"182c38a76e968ca7.mp3","What shall we call your cat?":"d7c7037e874c5c00.mp3"}